# Standing job-search criteria fed verbatim into LLM prompts (interview prep,
# matching). Copy to config/job_search_criteria.yml (gitignored) and set real
# values. If that file is absent, prompts get a neutral placeholder instead.
criteria:
  - "Compensation floor: <base-salary floor>; below it, culture/belonging has to carry real weight."
  - "Weight team culture and being genuinely wanted above marginal comp — a first-class factor, not a tiebreaker."
  - "<Location / work-authorization constraint, e.g. US-only>."
  - "Target level is sized to company stage (Staff/Principal through CTO), not a fixed title."
